  "limitations": [
    "Three final-layer NexusCRM sources are counted separately: custom quote product, quote line item and opportunity line item. Row observations, exact whole-record versions and source-local Id groups are different units; none is a validated unique business line, product owner, customer or incident count.",
    "Every source row and repeated occurrence remains in the private census. Whole-record versions include excluded financial, quantity, term, payload and ingestion changes. No latest version, synthetic compound key or deduplicated business record is elected; multiversion and single-version Id groups alike are not admitted reference targets.",
    "Candidate identifiers use private source-and-role-qualified groups under a declared conservative syntax: nonempty strings of at most 256 Unicode characters without padding, whitespace or Unicode control/format characters. Numeric and boolean types are not coerced. This is not authoritative native-ID grammar, SQL varchar(255) conformance or SQL collation equality.",
    "Custom Quote__c, native QuoteId and OpportunityId remain separately named roles in separate source classes. Product2Id and PricebookEntryId are unresolved roles only in the declared line-item sources. Equal strings or group counts do not establish shared members, one line-item grain, namespace equivalence or target membership.",
    "Per-Id role cardinality reports zero, one or multiple observed strict groups and unverified observations. It is an intra-source structural diagnostic, not a parent join or reference-integrity result. Different role values across versions do not by themselves prove a conflict; no unmatched-target category is computed.",
    "Three reviewed SQL schemas contribute exact column names to presence coverage only. SQL types, defaults, NOT NULL, primary/unique keys and utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation are not imposed on JSON observations. DDL-only reference-like fields remain presence/type only. NetFees__c/Net_fees__c, Term_Months__c/Term_Mounths__c and other exact case/spelling variants remain distinct.",
    "Known and late-discovered fields have complete all-row presence partitions, including absence. Additional field names and private hashes are omitted; only their source-local count is published. First-row inventory schemas and DDL do not establish actual all-row types.",
    "IsDeleted and applicable Recalculate__c fields receive fixed literal/type categories without deletion or recalculation semantics. Dates receive fixed calendar/syntax categories without raw timestamps, epochs, ordering, durations, effective-time attribution, latest-state election or current-state conclusions.",
    "Prices, fees, discounts, quantities, line numbers, currencies, terms, descriptions, names, owner/person identifiers and source metadata are presence/type only. Exact typed whole-record hashing preserves precision, scalar types and signed zero internally; no raw values, identifiers, per-record hashes, amounts, totals, URLs or credentials are exported.",
    "No parent projection or target data was read, and no bridge hash, target lookup, native/polymorphic join, raw/final union, cross-CRM mapping, financial comparison, revenue/ARR, company/customer/Hong Kong attribution or incident-impact conclusion is made. Future target work requires separately reviewed contracts and explicit approval.",
    "The exporter recomputes the retained private assessment read-only. Original source parsing and byte/EOF truth rely on frozen scan receipts and unchanged archive identity; no archive is reread by the exporter."
  ],
  "source_integrity": {
